Smith: Suth? Wake up ol' boyo. Always sleeping so bloody late.
Sutherland: (chuckles) Aye, stayed up 'till the wee hours with your mum.
Smith: (laughs heartily) You bastard. Aye, listen, a ship's expected tonight so keep an eye out. Haste ye back!
Narrator: The radio goes quiet. It fades to night time.